+// runs of spaces, extra or missing fields, out-of-range and malformed numbers, stray CRs, a
+// missing final line break) parsed by SessionDescription.UnmarshalString, against a model of
+// RFC 4566 section 5 as the package documents it (the state table in unmarshal.go). Compared:
+// the error class, or every field of the description.
